{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892060/extras/final_storebanner.png?t=1740070165\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892060/extras/final_gif01.gif?t=1740070165\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your deck for the ultimate roguelike deckbuilder experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cards and other loot and use them to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt your deck to your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan out your moves to outsmart your enemies in this turn-based card battler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892060/extras/final_gif02.gif?t=1740070165\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly generated stages - play a new map each time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new cards to add into your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your cards in various different ways, such as giving them extra effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different enemies with unique abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple stages, each with a random powerful boss at the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consumable items that are helpful when you're in a pickle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect relics to become more powerful. Your enemies may also have relics of their own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random events - full of surprises! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom mode, where you can choose among various modifiers to spice up the gameplay or increase the challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overtime mode - 10 tiers of increasingly harder runs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stage 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/11f646a6c9acf910f43e0904c81794f647d2fd6d.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/128d4a55df6640dc4138f846f2126a0469513140.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/884b1871297c58f273751372195d2fc214d29f36.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/4f2c8682d30fadb6b86f66d55b3c95b194cd5960.jpg"},{"name":"Overtime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/d03c2e9c39ec6ddf4cae5bf88a72c75c1768bae7.jpg"},{"name":"Custom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/661e8855dd91afb886736a1f328edfef5977e5ac.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Ticket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/dd88493e57ce5390becafa73ab55c659d7f38168.jpg"},{"name":"High Score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/a95853841852977d492aa673668e594002db03ea.jpg"},{"name":"Do You Know Card Toons?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/dd78ade5e10b581c1414822bbf39e488c7dee291.jpg"},{"name":"Reliable Companion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892060/194c0a9703dbe2030645e9aa8448fd988e622421.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2892060?t=1740070165","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2892060?t=1740070165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892060/capsule_23